{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "d8d2c663e1d2876af75c551fd8e23b9f185b1a1e062d5c5cf24297a763e254cb", "ja": "魅裏怨 -うらない-", "zh": "魅里怨──占卜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8aec19e1dbe1eedda22abc35a55d313312919ea0b459d537c5b14b3eecbc6f21", "ja": "放課後の教室で、可奈と美奈子は降霊ごっこ\n『ぷっぷかさん』で遊んでいた。そこにオカ\nルト部の部長・瑞希が現れ、ぷっぷかさんを\n呼び出した後の対処法を助言する。可奈は助\n言に従い、枕元に和三盆を置いて就寝した。", "zh": "可奈与美奈子在放学后的教室玩着招魂游戏\n『噗、噗卡小姐』。此时超自然研究社的社长\n瑞希出现了，她针对召唤出噗、噗卡小姐后的\n应对方法，向两人提出了建议。\n可奈听从建言，在枕边放了和三盆后就寝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "f72bbe8217082733a8516519a924a43ac3d29cf7bcf4d284d19a2ea9cde7322a", "ja": "この学校の生徒達の間で、最近流行っている占い……。\nそれは子供じみた『降霊ごっこ』……。", "zh": "最近，这间学校的学生之间流行着一种占卜……\n那就是幼稚的『招魂游戏』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "a908da7a8cd1695dc80a20f2d5109117707c3410c2b080d6548d674c1b27e19d", "ja": "少女達の好奇心を満たす、他愛もないお遊び。放課後の\n教室で少女達は今日も見えない誰かに語りかける……。", "zh": "这是用来满足少女们好奇心的无聊游戏。\n少女们今天也在放学后的教室里，对无形的某人说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "11e2dedc7548a743fafca26ac9db89536a943e2779c1c8a22493b889564e161b", "ja": "ぷっぷかさん、ぷっぷかさん、お答えください。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐，噗、噗卡小姐，请回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "11e2dedc7548a743fafca26ac9db89536a943e2779c1c8a22493b889564e161b", "ja": "ぷっぷかさん、ぷっぷかさん、お答えください。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐，噗、噗卡小姐，请回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "4645467f5e4fcfd9fdfcc578308cff9d5104cd8b1425543d71207e0b3ffc9747", "ja": "可奈ちゃんは、歌手になれますか？", "zh": "可奈能够成为歌手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "a5c757afa1073b4279b71c9a3859f14bc998886ed18dd69dcae627ed240626bc", "ja": "『Yes』、だって！　可奈ちゃんの将来は歌姫か～。\n幼なじみのお姉さんとして、鼻が高いなぁ♪", "zh": "她说『Yes』耶！可奈将来会成为歌姬啊～\n身为从小一起长大的姊姊，真为你感到骄傲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "da753d2d15a7b55d6593962184b06d40db69aa3c32636e023b48230749769dc3", "ja": "え、ええ～？　そんなこと言って……。\n美奈子さんが動かしたんじゃないですか？", "zh": "咦、咦咦～？虽然你这么说……\n但这应该是美奈子移动的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "387b1c63f9df0c2426d404ac52cc7d5ecd6d2fcb62ff9174de901e0d2d0aa3b0", "ja": "それに私、今日も音楽の先生に、\n音程が全然違うって注意されちゃったし。", "zh": "而且我今天也被音乐课的老师念了，\n说我的音准完全没抓到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "8116fbb153721f41ea4ab0e801063a8b597f072daf5bb96a53be021c18b433d7", "ja": "そうなの？　可奈ちゃんの歌、私は好きだけどな。\nのびのびしてて、聞いてると笑顔になっちゃう！", "zh": "是这样吗？不过我很喜欢可奈唱的歌呢。\n听起来轻松自在，会让人不禁露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "681ed703b08e7e338ef8c4def72ee1501ad0688b884dc74f98a139e250497e62", "ja": "えへっ。そう言ってくれるの、美奈子さんだけです。\nクラリネットなら、ほめられるんだけど～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，会对我这么说的就只有美奈子而已。\n竖笛的话倒是有被夸奖啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "0108e8a07ed8f26aa5ee99d761c5bfe3b33f003daac74d1c56c620efb9b033b1", "ja": "吹奏楽部の全国大会に向けて、頑張ってるもんね。\nそうだ！　明日は差し入れにプチシュー作ってあげる！", "zh": "毕竟你非常努力为管乐社的全国大赛做准备呢。\n对了！明天就做小泡芙给你当慰劳品吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e064d174c4563040164f5af18efd6905b2b13c46aed459eb01a87827aed6e04", "ja": "やったぁ！　美奈子さんのプチシュー♪\nおなかも私も大満足～♪", "zh": "太棒了！美奈子的小泡芙♪\n肚里心里都满足～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "97ddb89f87adfebf381c3c04bbd190d3b3f5c94b17563d0d5dd332a57760c7dd", "ja": "ふふっ！　あ、そうだ。\n大会のことも、ぷっぷかさんに聞いてみようよ。", "zh": "呵呵！啊，对了，\n也向噗、噗卡小姐问问看大赛的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "1982717c49f29f3b19b05883e13a509e0a6449fb3cf9a4e8f2b3297605365356", "ja": "ぷっぷかさん、ぷっぷかさん。可奈ちゃんの\n吹奏楽部は、今度の全国大会で優勝できますか？", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐，噗、噗卡小姐，\n可奈的管乐社能够在这次的全国大赛获得冠军吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
