{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "789b54cd52403af71dd095c0c35a98a083a2bf66b93eaccfed30cf62e81f9151", "ja": "びっくりした～。だ、誰ですか～？", "zh": "吓我一跳～你、你是谁呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "142fb5edeba39063da66f9e53456b80d0de2ad3be83bea012449d437b64bcafd", "ja": "オカルト部部長、真壁瑞希です。", "zh": "我是超自然研究社社长，真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "427ba28aace99d5e9a66be43859e966d28df7b59e457a1a97c8df282e0f27e1e", "ja": "オカルトぶ？", "zh": "超自然研究社？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "c930b95feaaaa7c93ff35c68ab6a66e058cbc78f0154ca6325e61f610d628eeb", "ja": "超自然的な現象について研究する部活で……\nちなみに部員は、私ひとり。……ぽつーん。", "zh": "是研究超自然现象的社团……\n顺带一提社员只有我一人……（孤零零）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "969f4a7925693ed0646fd25707c943b6681775b35a2d30e3d7dd4c9f66e40888", "ja": "よかったら、入部しませんか？", "zh": "不嫌弃的话，要不要入社呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "18a9e54acacef1be448088c872a93833a57df70d9bf0ae893bc66e1056762833", "ja": "しません！　私は調理部だし、可奈ちゃんは\n吹奏楽部で大切な大会を控えてるんだから。", "zh": "不要！我已经加入烹饪社了，\n而可奈是管乐社员，正准备参加重要的大赛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "6705792ebd00ad54ec851697d1ba8c565bdba07111b34afee520a124b30cb01f", "ja": "あの……勧誘ですか？\nだったら私達、もう帰りますけど……。", "zh": "那个……你是来招募社员的吗？\n这样的话，我们已经要回去啰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "01e28980994814d835f5a7312a5d58f66463c761f7019d3fb319c6875f6c5190", "ja": "待ってください。ぷっぷかさんを呼び出す時には、\n後始末をしないと、呪われます。", "zh": "请等一下，在召唤出噗、噗卡小姐时，\n如果没有善后将会被诅咒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "c8033e71fc3212b426aacefe0b99146d4bf512b8e4a10c5da4e979d23b3dd4e3", "ja": "あ、知ってますよ。こうやって……\nぷっぷかさん、ぷっぷかさん、お帰りください。", "zh": "啊，这我知道喔，只要像这样……\n噗、噗卡小姐，噗、噗卡小姐，请回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "741ff4ea375cb6b20879915409965aff8f4f0b11081cec75f046b68197d0f20e", "ja": "それだけでは不十分です。", "zh": "光是这样还不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "372895d97bdce856ffd1428372bcd31934f170b05cb96516502d7063972b997c", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんを呼び出した日には、寝る前に、\nあるものを枕元に置いておかなくてはならないのです。", "zh": "在召唤出噗、噗卡小姐的日子，\n必须在睡前把某样东西放在枕边才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_01_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "2cc55467c707ee2bd822284e83b7a2c1ab4edf5ddd61b72db92cb392f7b31cd7", "ja": "それは、さんぼ。わさんぼ……。", "zh": "那就是，一盆、两盆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
